+ | `SCRIPT_FIX` | Bug in existing script needs fixing |
+ | `NEW_CAPABILITY` | Script needs new feature/functionality |
+ | `REFERENCE_DOC` | Documentation needs updating |
+ | `WORKFLOW_CHANGE` | Agent workflow needs adjustment |
